{"3364010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VCO: Victor Charlie One", "steam_appid": 3364010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The world is occupied. Cities burn. Alien warships rule the skies. You command the last convoy carrying humanity’s final weapon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/de01a6d816cac331db5dd7b99906ffe4.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/de01a6d816cac331db5dd7b99906ffe4.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/de01a6d816cac331db5dd7b99906ffe4.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cross hostile territory, make impossible choices, and fight cinematic battles to deliver the shot that ends the war.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/19843937ab2aaab28a45d1b4342294fc.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/19843937ab2aaab28a45d1b4342294fc.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/19843937ab2aaab28a45d1b4342294fc.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/a08e28ac8f1cd66732d25e57678d5e1a.avif?t=1787154402\" width=923 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dynamic Cinematic Combat.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive, real-time battles unfold as your convoy races through hostile territory. Issue layered commands, deploy powerful abilities, and outmaneuver overwhelming forces in tactical encounters that feel as intense as they look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/8ccba2b6436220f67720808793e9a687.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/8ccba2b6436220f67720808793e9a687.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/8ccba2b6436220f67720808793e9a687.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command. Customize. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, unlock new abilities, and integrate experimental tech as your convoy evolves each run. New commanders and vehicles await those bold enough to earn them, expanding your strategic options for future campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/f1c3e3c46e7cc0d98cb8114da41f6818.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/f1c3e3c46e7cc0d98cb8114da41f6818.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/f1c3e3c46e7cc0d98cb8114da41f6818.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge the Unknown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover alien tech and rare battlefield loot with unique modifiers and powerful effects. The right drop can reshape your build and swing the momentum of an entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Impossible Choices.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop is a gamble. Save civilians or conserve fuel. Protect your crew or push toward the objective. Your decisions echo across the entire campaign, and some losses are permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Under Occupation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across shattered cities, crumbling highways, and storm-ravaged frontiers, each with distinct environmental hazards and shifting weather conditions. Lightning strikes, dust storms, and broken terrain impose tactical constraints that force you to adapt, or fall behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete With Friends:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards in high-score runs and curated challenge modes. Only the strongest convoy reaches the final shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/95f06ea14dafd0ba6e6bf89efd84bdf9.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/95f06ea14dafd0ba6e6bf89efd84bdf9.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extr