tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/f1c3e3c46e7cc0d98cb8114da41f6818.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge the Unknown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover alien tech and rare battlefield loot with unique modifiers and powerful effects. The right drop can reshape your build and swing the momentum of an entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/895646af14f1a9ed7e1b9e12b5088a9c.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Impossible Choices.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop is a gamble. Save civilians or conserve fuel. Protect your crew or push toward the objective. Your decisions echo across the entire campaign, and some losses are permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/b8f7ac1d132a6e5c26e5635d9835af1e.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Under Occupation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across shattered cities, crumbling highways, and storm-ravaged frontiers, each with distinct environmental hazards and shifting weather conditions. Lightning strikes, dust storms, and broken terrain impose tactical constraints that force you to adapt, or fall behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/d9d9c88d7582811f3addb7ee2fc304b2.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete With Friends:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards in high-score runs and curated challenge modes. Only the strongest convoy reaches the final shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/95f06ea14dafd0ba6e6bf89efd84bdf9.poster.avif?t=1787154402\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/95f06ea14dafd0ba6e6bf89efd84bdf9.webm?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/extras/95f06ea14dafd0ba6e6bf89efd84bdf9.mp4?t=1787154402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "VCO is a convoy-driven roguelite set in a nation overrun by alien forces. Manage scavenged resources, customise your fleet, maintain your crew, and engage in action-packed explosive cinematic battles as you race toward the enemy as humanity’s last hope.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/e98e5b2bf6ee34eb41574bbfc7b12ccec951acdf/header.jpg?t=1787154402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/339f3aa706bd462d64e83204c5528d3cf1776f9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787154402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364010/339f3aa706bd462d64e83204c5528d3cf1776f9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787154402", "website": "https://www.systemsheavy.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed with Steam Deck compatibility in mind. Pre-release requirements are subject to change.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space